# 🎤 OPIc Question - Day21

## Question

How has your neighborhood changed compared with the past?

---

## Speaking Mission

Speak for 60–90 seconds.

Include:

- What your neighborhood was like before
- What it is like now
- One major change
- Why it changed
- How you feel about the change

---

## Challenge

Use today's expression:

> Compared with the past,...

Also try to use:

> These days,...

> One major difference is...

> As a result,...

---

## Recommended Structure

Compared with the past,...

↓

It used to be...

↓

These days,...

↓

One major difference is...

↓

I think this happened because...

↓

As a result,...

↓

Overall, I think...
